  "bio": "Rob Junod is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in traditional, neotraditional, and Japanese styles at Legacy Tattoo in Springfield, MO. Known for their crisp lines and vibrant color work, Rob ensures each piece is a masterpiece that stands the test of time. Clients appreciate Rob's professionalism that shines through in every interaction and in the meticulously maintained cleanliness of their workspace. For an exceptional tattoo experience, contact Rob at 417-771-5473.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Springfield, Missouri, United States"
